[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0472","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0472.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0434","title":"厂商 产品 漏洞类型","description":"Allmanage 管理系统存在管理员密码检索漏洞，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过特定接口或参数遍历/读取管理员账号密码信息。该漏洞源于权限控制缺失或敏感信息暴露，远程未授权攻击者可直接访问特定接口获取管理员凭证，进而完全控制管理后台。影响 Allmanage 管理系统相关版本，攻击者无需任何前置条件即可远程利用，直接导致管理员账号密码泄露并实现权限接管。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0434"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-13","updated":"2000-05-13","remediation":"建议立即升级 Allmanage 到最新版本，或联系厂商获取安全补丁修复管理员密码检索漏洞。临时缓解措施：限制管理后台访问IP白名单，禁用默认管理员账户，强制启用强密码策略，并在Web应用防火墙配置规则拦截密码找回接口的异常请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0434.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0434","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0434.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0434.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vhfh-368p-rg9f/GHSA-vhfh-368p-rg9f.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1217/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0434.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001375.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8c4383d71e419cb5a91546cd7835b4f02c87cdaa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0472.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0472.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0448","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0448.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0415","title":"Microsoft Outlook Express 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft Outlook Express 4.x 在处理邮件或新闻组消息中的 JPG/BMP 图片附件时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当附件文件名过长时，Outlook Express 未能正确验证文件名长度，导致缓冲区溢出，造成程序崩溃。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含特制长文件名图片附件的邮件来触发此漏洞，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Outlook Express 4.x 版本，无需用户交互即可触发，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0415"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:40.063","remediation":"Outlook Express 4.x 已停止支持且不再有安全更新，建议立即升级到受支持的 Microsoft Outlook 版本（如 Outlook 2016/2019/2021 或 Microsoft 365 桌面版），或改用 Windows 10/11 内置的邮件应用。临时缓解措施：在邮件客户端中禁用 HTML 渲染，不预览/打开来自不可信发件人的邮件附件，并在邮件服务器层面过滤带有超长文件名的 .jpg/.bmp 附件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0140.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1195","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0415.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0415.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0415","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/xaitax/SploitScan/blob/938d5f69569a096cf728175efd0ca15f6fd92c6a/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0415.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0415.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fcfq-f9jq-4c28/GHSA-fcfq-f9jq-4c28.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0415.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0448.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0334","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0334.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0407","title":"Sun Solaris netpr 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris netpr 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，源于对 -p 参数（打印机名称）缺乏长度校验。本地攻击者可通过向 netpr 程序传递过长的 -p 参数触发栈溢出，覆盖返回地址并执行任意代码，从而获得 netpr 进程权限（通常为 root 或 lp 用户权限）。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.6、7.0 和 8.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2（高危），攻击向量为本地，无需认证，攻击复杂度低，可完全破坏系统机密性、完整性和可用性。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，通过构造超长打印机名称参数调用 netpr 程序即可触发漏洞并执行任意命令。Sun Microsystems 已发布补丁修复此漏洞，建议升级至修复版本或限制 netpr 程序执行权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0407"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-12T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:39.103","remediation":"立即升级 Solaris 到包含安全更新的版本（如 Solaris 8 补丁集 8 月或更晚版本的 11/00 更新），或者应用特定的 netpr 补丁更新。更新系统可以修复原始的缓冲区溢出缺陷。作为紧急缓解措施，如果无法立即打补丁，可在 /etc/system 文件中添加 maxmemconsistentcheck 限制，以及通过修改 /usr/sbin/netpr 配置文件对 -p 参数启用长度验证。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0141.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1200","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19911","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0407.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0407","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0407.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0407.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x2j2-wmj4-cgv8/GHSA-x2j2-wmj4-cgv8.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0407.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001372.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0334.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0334.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1100","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0419","title":"Microsoft Office 2000 UA ActiveX控件 脚本安全漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office 2000 中的 UA ActiveX 控件被错误标记为\"对脚本安全\"，远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页，利用 Office 帮助系统中的\"Show Me\"功能调用该控件执行未授权操作，导致信息泄露、权限提升或任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Office 2000 所有版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0419"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-11T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:41.587","remediation":"Microsoft Office 2000 用户授权控件 (UA Control) 漏洞导致攻击者可通过 Office 帮助中的“显示”功能执行未授权操作。建议立即安装 Microsoft Office 2000 服务包 3 (SP3) 或更高版本，该服务包修复了 UA 控件的安全验证机制。您也可以安装 Microsoft Office 2000 更新程序 (SP3)，以增强控件的安全性。无法立即安装补丁时，可禁用 Office 2000 中的“帮助”功能，或通过修改注册表禁用 UA 控件以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-07.html","http://www.microsoft.com/technet/support/kb.asp?ID=262767","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1197","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-034","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0419.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0419","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0419.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0419.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g5jc-xm45-6763/GHSA-g5jc-xm45-6763.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/CERTCC/SBOM/blob/ae581e32992458f65018df4eced684b7370bba39/SwiftBOM/cpe_lookup/cve_lookup/microsoft/photodraw_2000_cve.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001367.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--cab02337-bf9b-4fbe-8f80-ecdd6ecda238.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1100.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0480","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0480.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0439","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 跨域 Cookie 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 4.0 和 5.0 存在跨域 Cookie 信息泄露漏洞。攻击者可构造包含目标域名及转义字符的恶意 URL，诱导已登录目标站点的用户点击该链接。当用户使用受影响版本的 IE 浏览器访问此恶意页面时，浏览器会将该目标域名的 Cookie 数据泄露给攻击者，导致会话令牌、身份凭证等敏感信息被窃取，进而引发会话劫持或账户信息泄露。该漏洞的利用需要较高的用户交互条件，攻击者必须先通过社会工程手段诱导用户点击恶意链接才能成功。Microsoft 已针对该漏洞发布安全补丁进行修复。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0439"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-11T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:44.173","remediation":"安装 Microsoft Security Bulletin MS00-033 安全补丁（对应 KB 文章 KB262509），该补丁修复了 Internet Explorer 4.0/4.01/5.0/5.01 中的未授权 Cookie 访问漏洞。受影响用户应升级至 Internet Explorer 5.01 或更高版本（IE 5.5 不受此漏洞影响）。如无法立即打补丁，可临时将浏览器安全区域设置为\"高\"，限制网页脚本执行并阻止跨域 Cookie 读取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1326","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1194","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000511135609.D7774%40securityfocus.com","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=NDBBKGHPMKBKDDGLDEEHAEHMDIAA.rms2000%40bellatlantic.net","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-033","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4447","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/84a32f54509ea69818fd2f28519fed9f2968cec3/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0439.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0439","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0439.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4efe50030f98e26c62a2548f14fe89d9f72e2021/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0439.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e34faa994a969a96da73434c6e96d687fa245753/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4rcm-2c69-4jh9/GHSA-4rcm-2c69-4jh9.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/slacker247/GPDA/blob/fa9006d0877a691f1ddffe88799c844a3e8a669a/Sodi/Run/IDSrules/rule.1099","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0439.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0480.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0454","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0454.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0421","title":"Bugzilla process_bug.cgi 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Bugzilla 的 process_bug.cgi 脚本存在命令注入漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向该脚本提交包含 shell 元字符（如反引号、管道符等）的特制请求，在目标服务器上以 Web 服务进程权限执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 Bugzilla 早期版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可能导致服务器被完全控制、数据泄露或进一步内网渗透。利用方式简单，仅需构造恶意 HTTP 请求即可触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0421"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-11T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:41.833","remediation":"升级 Bugzilla 至 2.12 或更高版本。具体操作：从 https://www.bugzilla.org/download/ 下载 2.12 及以上版本，备份现有数据库和配置文件后执行升级脚本。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器层面对 process_bug.cgi 实施访问控制，限制仅授权 IP 可访问，并禁用 CGI 对 shell 元字符的传递。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0128.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1199","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0421.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0421","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0421.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0421.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2pfv-488g-27p3/GHSA-2pfv-488g-27p3.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/bugzilla_remote_exec.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0421.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1199/info.html","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/bugzilla_remote_exec.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/b12a3924bcdfa7af53ab2da329173ee04bf863bc/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0454.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0454.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0454.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0453","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0453.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0420","title":"Microsoft Windows 2000 SYSKEY 默认密钥配置信息泄露漏洞","description":"Windows 2000 的 SYSKEY 默认配置将系统启动密钥存储在注册表中，本地攻击者可通过读取注册表获取该密钥，进而解密受 Encrypted File System (EFS) 保护的数据。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 所有版本，攻击者需具有本地访问权限才能利用，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。Microsoft 尚未发布官方补丁，建议用户手动启用 SYSKEY 的密码保护模式以降低风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0420"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-11T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:41.713","remediation":"运行 Syskey.exe 将启动密钥存储方式从「注册表存储」改为「密码启动」或「软盘启动」模式，防止密钥被本地提取。同时安装 Microsoft 为 Windows 2000 发布的相关安全更新（如 MS00-032），并限制物理访问权限，确保攻击者无法获得本地登录权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0112.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1198","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0420.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee