,"description":"微软 IIS 4.0/5.0 的 ISM.DLL 模块存在文件名处理漏洞，攻击者可通过向服务器发送包含大量编码空格（%20）的文件名请求并以 .htr 扩展名结尾，利用服务器错误解析触发文件碎片读取，导致读取目标系统中的任意文件。该漏洞影响 Windows 平台上的 IIS 4.0 和 5.0 服务，支持远程非认证攻击，存在较低的利用难度，可直接导致系统文件泄露，甚至为进一步攻击提供信息支持。微软已发布安全补丁修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0457"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-11T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:46.553","remediation":"升级到Microsoft IIS 6.0或更高版本，应用安全补丁并关闭.htr文件扩展处理。修改IIS元数据库配置，禁用向文件请求附加.htr扩展名的验证功能，并确保已安装最新的安全性更新。如无法立即升级，可通过防火墙规则阻止对.htr扩展名的请求流量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95810120719608&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1193","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-031","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4448","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19908","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2000/CVE-2000-0457.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0457.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0457","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0457.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0457.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w5j6-fmxr-5fr8/GHSA-w5j6-fmxr-5fr8.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0457.yaml","https://github.com/chihsuan/search-engine/blob/9dcdd3e644469883f53565740f0ba8ff617c5120/Data/E99D88C1-C798-40D7-BB8C-47E6405B9469.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0457.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0379.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0335","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0335.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0408","title":"微软 IIS 4.0/5.0 文件扩展拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 存在 URL 恶意文件扩展名解析漏洞，攻击者可通过向服务器发送包含大量文件扩展名的超长复杂 URL 触发该漏洞，导致 IIS 服务崩溃并造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行 IIS 4.0/5.0 的 Windows 2000/XP/2003 系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，通过精心构造的恶意 URL 耗尽服务器资源，使 IIS 托管的网站服务完全不可用，用户无法正常访问 Web 服务。该漏洞源于 IIS 对 URL 中文件扩展名解析逻辑存在缺陷，无法正确处理异常长度的扩展名序列，导致服务进程异常终止。攻击者只需发送单个恶意 HTTP 请求即可触发拒绝服务，攻击门槛低、危害大，建议立即升级至 IIS 5.0 SP1 或更高版本，或安装微软安全公告 MS00-057 提供的补丁程序（KB269862）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0408"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-11T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:39.220","remediation":"建议立即升级 IIS 至 5.0 SP1 或更高版本，或安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-057 提供的补丁程序（KB269862）。若暂无法升级，可在 IIS 服务器前部署 WAF 或应用层防火墙，配置规则拦截包含异常长文件扩展名的恶意 URL 请求（如包含大量连续点号或扩展名的请求），同时在 IIS 中禁用不必要的脚本映射扩展名以减少攻击面。建议同时在防火墙层面限制非必要的外部访问 IIS 管理端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.microsoft.com/technet/support/kb.asp?ID=260205","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1190","http://www.ussrback.com/labs40.html","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-030","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19907","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0408.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0408.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0408","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2000/CVE-2000-0408.rules","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0408.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0408.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wx3j-8h4r-qj57/GHSA-wx3j-8h4r-qj57.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0408.yaml","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/I/iis_dos_ussrback.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0335.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0335.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0335.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0439","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0439.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0410","title":"Allaire ColdFusion Server 4.5.1 文件缓存拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Allaire ColdFusion Server 4.5.1 的文件缓存组件存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向服务器发送大量针对 CFCACHE 标签缓存文件的重复请求，由于这些缓存文件未被存储在内存中，导致服务器资源被耗尽，从而引发拒绝服务。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，仅需网络访问即可触发，影响 ColdFusion Server 4.5.1 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0410"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-10T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:39.460","remediation":"升级 ColdFusion Server 至 4.5.2 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可在 ColdFusion 管理后台禁用 CFCACHE 标签缓存功能，或限制对缓存文件的直接 HTTP 访问（通过 Web 服务器 URL 重写规则拦截对缓存目录的请求）。鉴于该产品已极为老旧，建议迁移至受支持的 Adobe ColdFusion 现代版本（2016/2021/2023）或替代平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ntbugtraq.com/default.asp?pid=36&sid=1&A2=ind0005&L=ntbugtraq&F=&S=&P=4843","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1192","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0410.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0410","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0410.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0410.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xm2m-chg4-j873/GHSA-xm2m-chg4-j873.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0410.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001363.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8b2b9a8673bea39f5c895cdb2f43d026330c1de0/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0439.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0439.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0436","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0436.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0406","title":"Netscape Navigator 和 Communicator 无效SSL证书警告旁路漏洞","description":"Netscape Navigator 4.07 及 Communicator 4.73 之前版本存在 SSL 证书验证缺陷，未能正确校验 SSL 证书有效性。远程攻击者可利用该漏洞将合法 Web 服务器的流量重定向至恶意服务器，实施中间人攻击窃取用户敏感信息，被称为 \"Acros-Suencksen SSL\" 漏洞。影响范围为 Netscape Navigator 4.07 及 Communicator 4.73 前版本，攻击条件需诱导用户访问恶意站点或实施中间人劫持，CVSS 评分 2.6，危害等级较低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0406"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-10T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:38.967","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Netscape Communicator 4.73 或 Navigator 4.07 及以上版本，可从 Netscape 官网下载最新版本安装包覆盖安装。如无法立即升级，建议暂停使用 Netscape 访问 HTTPS 站点，改用已修复 SSL 证书验证漏洞的其他浏览器（如 IE 5.0+）访问敏感站点，并避免在不可信网络环境下进行敏感操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.acrossecurity.com/aspr/ASPR-2000-04-06-1-PUB.txt","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-05.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-028.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1188","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0406.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0406","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0406.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0406.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4x6c-6ppx-5vjq/GHSA-4x6c-6ppx-5vjq.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--668846a1-1d8a-4754-aa60-214b2c110902.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0406.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001361.txt","https://github.com/c2siorg/bug-connector/blob/68c960cc01a4f61c238e8a780d2247db700d4a9b/Datasets/Mapped_CVE_file.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0436.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0339","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0339.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0411","title":"Matt Wright FormMail CGI 环境变量泄露漏洞","description":"Matt Wright FormMail CGI 脚本 1.6/1.7/1.8 版本存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 env_report 参数发送特制请求，无需身份认证即可获取服务器环境变量（如系统路径、配置文件路径等敏感信息），导致敏感数据泄露。该漏洞影响 FormMail 1.6、1.7 及 1.8 版本，攻击复杂度低，仅需网络访问即可利用。官方已停止维护，建议用户迁移至替代方案。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0411"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-10T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:39.580","remediation":"立即升级 Matt Wright FormMail 至 1.9 或更高版本，该版本已移除 env_report 参数功能。如无法升级，直接删除或禁用 FormMail CGI 脚本，改用更安全的现代表单处理方案（如支持输入验证的 Perl/PHP 邮件脚本）。同时确保 CGI 目录权限设置为 755，避免其他环境变量泄露。作为临时缓解措施，可在 Web 服务器配置中拒绝包含 env_report 参数的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0125.html","http://www.perfectotech.com/blackwatchlabs/vul5_10.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1187","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19906","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0411.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0411","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0411.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0411.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gggj-8j7g-cpwh/GHSA-gggj-8j7g-cpwh.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0411.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001364.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0339.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0339.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0339.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0338","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0338.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0409","title":"Netscape Communicator 证书导入符号链接漏洞","description":"Netscape Communicator 4.73 及更早版本在导入新证书时存在符号链接跟随漏洞。当用户导入证书时，程序会以不安全的方式操作 /tmp 目录下的临时文件，本地攻击者可通过在 /tmp 目录下预先创建符号链接，指向目标用户的可写文件，诱使目标用户导入证书从而触发该漏洞，导致攻击者可以覆盖目标用户的任意文件。该漏洞影响 Netscape Communicator 4.5 至 4.73 版本，CVSS 评分 3.7，危害等级低，攻击复杂度较高，需要本地访问权限及用户交互。","severity":"LOW","score":3.7,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0409"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-10T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:39.343","remediation":"立即升级至 Netscape Communicator 4.74 或更高版本，该版本已修复导入证书时跟随符号链接的问题。由于 Netscape 产品线已停止维护，建议迁移至 Mozilla Firefox 或 Google Chrome 等现代浏览器。临时缓解措施：在导入证书前手动清理 /tmp 目录中的可疑符号链接，或以非特权用户身份执行证书导入操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-05/0126.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1201","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19912","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0409.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0409","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0409.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0409.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m59v-mjv4-379q/GHSA-m59v-mjv4-379q.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0409.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0b1c6b3d-7e35-422f-9389-2acc12a3e523.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--0b1c6b3d-7e35-422f-9389-2acc12a3e523.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0338.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0295","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0295.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0304","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 HTR请求拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 及 5.0 版本中，当安装了 IISADMPWD 虚拟目录时，inetinfo.exe 程序对畸形的 HTR 请求存在输入验证缺陷。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器发送特制的未分隔（Undelimited）HTR 请求，触发 inetinfo.exe 进程崩溃，导致 IIS 服务拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows NT/2000 平台上的 IIS 4.0 和 5.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。微软已发布安全公告 MS00-028 修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0304"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-05-10T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:26.273","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全更新 MS00-031 补丁包，或升级至 Windows 2000 Service Pack 1 及以上版本。若无法升级，可在 IIS 管理器中删除 IISADMPWD 虚拟目录映射，或禁用 .htr 脚本映射以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1191","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise52.php3","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-031","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0304.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0304.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0304","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2000.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0304.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0304.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7qq3-2c7j-qq7w/GHSA-7qq3-2c7j-qq7w.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-iis.rules","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0304.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0304.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0295.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0295.toml"}]